cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DockStart, please cite this software and separately cite
  AutoDock Vina and the other scientific tools used in your workflow.
type: software
title: "DockStart: a local Windows GUI for AutoDock Vina"
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: XinXi
repository-code: "https://github.com/xuxinxi14/DockStart"
url: "https://github.com/xuxinxi14/DockStart"
version: 1.0.4
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  DockStart is an open-source Windows workbench with Chinese guidance
  for PDBQT import or preparation, docking-box setup, AutoDock Vina
  execution, pose viewing and traceable local experiment records.
  Version 1.0.4 is a public trial; full installer, GUI and scientific
  acceptance remain incomplete. DockStart does not change Vina's
  search algorithm or scoring function. Docking scores cannot replace
  experimental validation.
keywords:
  - molecular-docking
  - autodock-vina
  - protein-ligand-docking
  - computational-chemistry
  - cheminformatics
  - windows
